Blinkered word list for Nederlands (nl)
SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of nl AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=nl`.

Distributed under BSD-3-Clause, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

Ordering
  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus via OPUS
  MIT

Validation
  hunspell `nl` (BSD-3-Clause) — OpenTaal

The full text of each licence is in ../licences/.
